# ================================================================
# The contract gate — same two invariants as the PNG harness, against
# chitra_jpeg_decode.
# ================================================================
# A real libjpeg-turbo 24x16 grayscale baseline JPEG (sampling 1x1). Byte 100 is
# the SOF0 sampling nibble; patching it is how the 0.6.0 non-interleaved path is
# reached, and the fixture is otherwise untouched. See
# tests/tcyr/jpeg_noninterleaved.tcyr for the corpus provenance.
